{"assets":["/statement-assets/e8f472e899400c7d066775af89d4a9a17de1e417e7644847751ac8e375187224.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"741","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Arpa's loud Owf and Mehrdad's evil plan"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As you have noticed, there are lovely girls in Arpa’s land."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"People in Arpa's land are numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". Everyone has exactly one crush, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th person's crush is person with the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"crushi"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/e8f472e899400c7d066775af89d4a9a17de1e417e7644847751ac8e375187224.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Someday Arpa shouted "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Owf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" loudly from the top of the palace and a funny game started in Arpa's land. The rules are as follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The game consists of rounds. Assume person "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" wants to start a round, he calls "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"crushx"},{"kind":"text","text":" and says: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Oww...wwf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (the letter "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"w"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is repeated "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" times) and cuts off the phone immediately. If "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t > 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" then "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"crushx"},{"kind":"text","text":" calls "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"crushcrushx"},{"kind":"text","text":" and says: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Oww...wwf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (the letter "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"w"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is repeated "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" times) and cuts off the phone immediately. The round continues until some person receives an \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Owf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"). This person is called the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Joon-Joon"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the round. There can't be two rounds at the same time."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mehrdad has an evil plan to make the game more funny, he wants to find smallest "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t ≥ 1"},{"kind":"text","text":") such that for each person "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":", if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" starts some round and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" becomes the Joon-Joon of the round, then by starting from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" would become the Joon-Joon of the round. Find such "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" for Mehrdad if it's possible."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Some strange fact in Arpa's land is that someone can be himself's crush (i.e. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"crushi = i"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of people in Arpa's land."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"crushi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ crushi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th person's crush."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there is no "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" satisfying the condition, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Otherwise print such smallest "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n2 3 1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n4 4 4 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n2 1 4 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample suppose "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t = 3"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the first person starts some round:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first person calls the second person and says \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Owwwf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", then the second person calls the third person and says \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Owwf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", then the third person calls the first person and says \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Owf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", so the first person becomes Joon-Joon of the round. So the condition is satisfied if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The process is similar for the second and the third person."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the fourth person starts some round:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The fourth person calls himself and says \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Owwwf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", then he calls himself again and says \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Owwf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", then he calls himself for another time and says \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Owf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", so the fourth person becomes Joon-Joon of the round. So the condition is satisfied when "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the last example if the first person starts a round, then the second person becomes the Joon-Joon, and vice versa."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"741A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/741/problem/A"}